ManifoldVelo builds on the RNA kinetic formulation and software development
of TSvelo (Jiachen Li and collaborators):
https://github.com/lijc0804/TSvelo

The original TSvelo MIT license and copyright notice are reproduced verbatim
in LICENSES/TSvelo-MIT.txt. Original TSvelo components retain that license;
the Academic Research Only license applies to the ManifoldVelo contributions.

The model implementation was assembled from the frozen ManifoldVelo paper
snapshot. Provenance and changes to import paths are recorded in
provenance/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json. This distribution does not vendor PyTorch,
Scanpy, scVelo, VeloCycle, or other comparison methods. Those projects retain
their respective licenses and citations.
